# Bug trend
data bugs = week,open bugs; W37,340; W38,318; W39,291; W40,264; W41,238; W42,212
chart line bugs y=open bugs labels=end title="Open bugs by week"
Open bugs are falling by about 26 a week, which would leave about 80 open by the alpha review on 2026-11-20.

# Features
